neohugo began as a fork of Hugo (https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo). Versions 0.148.2 and
earlier were Hugo's Go code with neohugo's changes; version 0.149 and later are a rewrite in
Rust that includes material derived from Hugo: templates rewritten from Hugo's embedded
templates (Go templates to Tera), Hugo's LiveReload plugin, behaviour transcribed from Hugo's
Go sources, and Hugo's test data and documentation used as test fixtures. PROVENANCE.md lists
each such file, its source and how it was changed.

